  "description": "the E-Inception TR 8.8.1 FEQ is the flagship model of the STEVENS E-Crossover full-suspension e-bike range. This full-suspension SUV e-bike is based on the multi-award-winning E-Inception E-MTB series and impresses with a premium mix of components. Whether it’s the powerful Fox suspension with 120 millimetres of travel or the 5th-generation Bosch Performance Line CX drive. Also on board and guaranteeing maximum range is the removable, 800 Wh Bosch PowerTube battery. The Bosch eBike ABS ensures outstanding riding safety and the best possible braking performance in all weather conditions and on all terrain, bringing you to a powerful and, above all, safe stop at any time. The standard-fit Bosch ConnectModule offers additional security against theft. The Bosch Premium Service eBike Alarm (available via the Bosch eBike Flow app and the Flow+ function) offers visual and audible alarm signals as well as location tracking in the event of theft.",
